;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-09-18/03-qwen-qwen3-8-27b.png\" alt=\"Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen3.8-27B是一款经过后训练的通用大语言模型，提供完整的权重与配置参数。该模型全面兼容Hugging Face Transformers、vLLM及SGLang等主流推理框架，便于开发者在各类高性能计算环境中快速部署和应用。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-09-18/04-m-a-p-yue2-3b.png\" alt=\"m-a-p/YuE2-3B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">m-a-p/YuE2-3B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">YuE2-3B是一款专注于音乐创作的生成式模型，具备3B参数规模。该模型的核心特色在于支持可编辑的乐谱生成，能够为音乐创作提供灵活的创作辅助，适用于对音频生成效果及结构编排有特定要求的专业领域。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-09-18/05-tokenrhythm-neohorse-1-4b.png\" alt=\"TokenRhythm/NeoHorse-1-4B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">TokenRhythm/NeoHorse-1-4B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">NeoHorse-1-4B是一款拥有4B参数的小型模型，主要通过代理（Agentic）后训练与路由机制实现。该模型的研究重心在于探索递归自我改进能力，旨在提升模型在自动化任务处理与复杂代理场景下的任务解决效能。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qHfXxy1pes1eXWicJWxHTLGxL323Gh029A2JkOLQP3EibEUYlkLeB2vgvuhnUoyqoPg1etjxySFodeOgR45dHqS2s2kZ8KyjA65MCPMPbBBGo/0?wx_fmt=gif\" alt=\"底部引导\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section><